            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f2" n="64" xml:id="d172-f2-content">
                <p>Military leader recently joining forces with the Nationalists.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f3" n="65" xml:id="d172-f3-content">
                <p>Commander in chief of Nationalist Revolutionary army in North China.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f4" n="66" xml:id="d172-f4-content">
                <p>Chairman, Nationalist Government Council, Nanking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d172-f5" n="67" xml:id="d172-f5-content">
                <p>Gen. Pao Yu-lin, commanding Forty-seventh Brigade under the Peking
                    Government.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
